"lookout-back": "<div style=\"position: relative; width: 264px; height: 408px; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: #FFF4DE; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(27,27,47,.18); border: 1px solid #E6D8BC; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 10px; border: 2.5px solid #1B1B2F; border-radius: 10px\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 24px 22px 22px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Dela Gothic One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #1B1B2F\">THE LOOKOUT</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.35\"><b style=\"color: #1F8F6B\">1</b><span>Starts across from the first Town Leader.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.35\"><b style=\"color: #1F8F6B\">2</b><span>After scoring, point at one searcher (not you): “Go check out that light.”</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.35\"><b style=\"color: #1F8F6B\">3</b><span>They look at their card and the deck’s top card, mix them face down, and put one in their stand without looking. The other goes under the deck.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.35\"><b style=\"color: #1F8F6B\">4</b><span>Pass this card clockwise.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
